<LegalDoc
	title="Support"
	description="Get help with Alkalye and its ChatGPT connection."
>
	<h2>Get help</h2>
	<p>Email <a href="mailto:assmann@hey.com" class="text-brand hover:underline">assmann@hey.com</a> with a short description of the problem.</p>
	<p>For MCP connection issues, include the provider, the action attempted, and the approximate time. Never send your Alkalye passphrase, OAuth tokens, or document encryption keys.</p>

	<h2>Disconnect a client</h2>
	<p>Open Alkalye Settings, open Connections, then disconnect the client under MCP connections. This stops future requests from that connection.</p>

	<h2>Security reports</h2>
	<p>Report suspected security or privacy issues to the same address. Do not include sensitive document contents.</p>
</LegalDoc>
